#: src/big_remote_play/ui/host_view.py:428
msgid ""
"A screen larger than the other device is scaled down, which blurs small "
"text. For TVs and car screens, 1920 × 1080 is sharpest. The chosen screen "
"returns to normal afterwards. Choose a screen above first."
